<diagram program="umlet" version="15.1">
  <zoom_level>10</zoom_level>
  <help_text>Provider has already passed Verify Provider. Billing calls Verify Member again.
Save timestamp, service date, provider number, member number, service code, and up to 100 comment characters. A declined confirmation does not save a bill. Input/save retry paths are design assumptions.</help_text>
